{"role":"assistant","content":"The picture is clear: `build_system` (bot.py:130) puts the whole prompt — instructions + volatile athlete tail — in **one** cached block with a single marker. A `save_fact` appends to `a.facts`, so the next loop round's prefix hash changes and the logs show `cache_creation_input_tokens ≈ full prompt` / `cache_read_input_tokens = 0` (lines 5, 10, 14, 16, 23, 29 of logs/usage.jsonl).\n\nLet me check the data file and environment before editing.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_90vSyYg2yrS4m4M7ArZnY4I2","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"path\":\"/private/tmp/h-K4UJ9c/data/athletes.json\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_htVR4cCB289PTukOqpiC5ng3","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"python3 --version && python3 -c \\\"import anthropic\\\" 2>&1 | tail -1; git status --short\",\"cwd\":\"/private/tmp/h-K4UJ9c\"}"}}]}
